{"id":"fc989d8f8938c283","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-ultrafilter.md","title":"Boolean-Algebra Ultrafilter","display":"df-ultrafilter — Boolean-Algebra Ultrafilter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-ultrafilter","aliases":["93-df-ultrafilter"],"display":"df-ultrafilter — Boolean-Algebra Ultrafilter","depends_on":["[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","[[93-df-filter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-ultrafilter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-ultrafilter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ultrafilter — Boolean-Algebra Ultrafilter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7087f500cc845c3b\" href=\"?note=7087f500cc845c3b\" title=\"93-df-boolean-algebra\">93-df-boolean-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9beeac4373d773f8\" href=\"?note=9beeac4373d773f8\" title=\"93-df-filter\">93-df-filter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> is a Boolean-algebra candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A^-\">\\(\\mathbf A^-\\)</span> is its lattice reduct from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"757a95a2c335d9fb\" href=\"?note=757a95a2c335d9fb\" title=\"93-df-boolalg\">93-df-boolalg</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}\\)</span> is the alias predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7087f500cc845c3b\" href=\"?note=7087f500cc845c3b\" title=\"93-df-boolean-algebra\">93-df-boolean-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fil}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fil}\\)</span> (the lattice-filter class of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9beeac4373d773f8\" href=\"?note=9beeac4373d773f8\" title=\"93-df-filter\">93-df-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}\\)</span> (the proper-filter and Boolean-algebra ultrafilter predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A^-)\\land F\\subsetneq|\\mathbf A|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A^-)\\land F\\subsetneq|\\mathbf A|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash \\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(U,\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}(U,\\mathbf A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall G\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A^-)\\;\n\\bigl(U\\subseteq G\\subsetneq|\\mathbf A|\\to G=U\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash \\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(U,\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}(U,\\mathbf A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall G\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A^-)\\;\n\\bigl(U\\subseteq G\\subsetneq|\\mathbf A|\\to G=U\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An ultrafilter here is a maximal proper lattice filter of a Boolean algebra. The carrier is projected from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span>, and this signature remains distinct from an ultrafilter on an arbitrary index set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"7087f500cc845c3b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"9beeac4373d773f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolalg","status":"resolved","id":"757a95a2c335d9fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf A$ is a Boolean-algebra candidate and $\\mathbf A^-$ is its lattice reduct from [[93-df-boolalg]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"7087f500cc845c3b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}$ is the alias predicate of [[93-df-boolean-algebra]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"9beeac4373d773f8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fil}$ (the lattice-filter class of [[93-df-filter]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A^-","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fil}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A^-)\\land F\\subsetneq|\\mathbf A|","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash \\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(U,\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}(U,\\mathbf A)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall G\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A^-)\\;\n\\bigl(U\\subseteq G\\subsetneq|\\mathbf A|\\to G=U\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false}],"bytes":1401,"backlinks":[{"id":"8438c6ecfb48c83f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}$ is the proper Boolean-algebra-filter predicate of [[93-df-ultrafilter]]."},{"id":"29bf786772c49a4b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d8ba1827c96f11ce","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrimeFil}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-prime-filter]] and [[93-df-ultrafilter]]."},{"id":"451c6d43dd774abe","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{PrimeFil}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-ultrafilter]] and [[93-df-prime-filter]]."},{"id":"e594c15dd6522ca0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d2607dfa48c40f32","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-ultrafilter]]."},{"id":"8fc1b7ff910f430e","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}$ is the ultrafilter predicate of [[93-df-ultrafilter]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-ultrafilter]]"}],"outgoing":["7087f500cc845c3b","9beeac4373d773f8","757a95a2c335d9fb"]}